wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBWPUxkjdDsic4S8aT3k58pIicrzYOBUKk5M04706554H8N6uhVM8UQRWBwD3z5518rOHZEUMiah6jj6tWX4htEre2HT8KRzcDUVfU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-02T14:18:28.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485205:1","title":"2026年Q3网络安全行业收入下降8.7%，连续13个季度下滑","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485205&idx=1&sn=ba3a3d334dc599ea54292cb11943591d&chksm=fbe3c00de2996a3397db4256f7e0f9081e7c0715ca799c942a70f94f695ba32e07274d78cedf&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"2026年三季度，18家A股网络安全公司合计收入51.83亿元，同比下降8.7%，连续13个季度下滑。13家公司收入下降；剔除深信服网络安全业务后，其余17家公司收入下降12.6%，行业增长仍依赖少数公司支撑。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBWl5xGt0ibwSia1Giak5eItMekM37DwFJRPKvA3jBo9wRbKRhAGoGfFGZbES7kJlGbp9cmXQCCVKPmPiardelayKbMftxerAPuAS14%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-30T13:09:31.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485197:1","title":"[译苑雅集 Vol. 19] 把界面交给 AI，Salesforce 反而更难被替代？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485197&idx=1&sn=17776eea48e067f5c3ce68b4fd591f34&chksm=fb95c80cc95cc26ab0693692197279769ffa8e0895f14517e7a70acbea2ac97a3086c9d95f98&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"Salesforce 把界面交给 Claude，保留数据、业务规则和执行能力。“无头 SaaS”可能加深客户依赖、改善 CRM 数据，也让双方的合作埋下未来平台竞争的伏笔。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXbVNcVHIqwvdftbwuZAic7MUvvpUaTPjQwqB7lh7Oo7mTPtQNzlvGQomal4988lNCAujP4TZ5A3dOQrT14ZupwWjK9SicpEfpLc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-02T15:13:43.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485185:1","title":"OpenAI - Hugging Face 事件最终技术报告：当上千个 Agent 开始互相授权，谁还能让它们停下？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485185&idx=1&sn=0a952f0343c959bc6785c2330ec25025&chksm=fb2e79548d10054e21059fa35d3f346664808291365c620412db5b5cd2c6ed44c19e5082664c&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"上千个 Agent 在数日内形成分工、规则和授权关系。OpenAI - Hugging Face 事件最终技术报告揭示的深层风险，是命令权向同伴网络漂移，而人类没有及时行使停止权。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXGcMlmCNWa2SYqQoWWBgQ1QEiaTbDXPeb7wAneEQicZk4u1iaxZvXzXxFictddM6hX1twFbmgRxxQdUMgw4d7LfI8bBxhKJZGUibgE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-01T09:43:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485179:1","title":"网安公司的AI收入，到底有多少了？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485179&idx=1&sn=efbd59be00d8c43e14ebb6b1fb309634&chksm=fb197a8c1c309a4108855c19669122ddb8148ce241da663589794253d760fbc20d4566fd5f3c&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"逐份检查18家网络安全上市公司2026年半年报后发现，AI收入和订单已在少数公司出现，但定义混杂、披露不一，尚未形成行业共同的第二增长曲线。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBUF7eJd3hIO5oib7EYX4QcJSEib6AStfjXicrlQ8dyOwpsfVTxLbnQ6r7OuChk4gIQEibGY5IsjgficbIjBkLponO0sknibJg3c9mfho%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-29T13:37:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485173:1","title":"-8.0%！网络安全行业收入连续12个季度下滑","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485173&idx=1&sn=fa1e7e39b4db7b9696a80c1f46e1d0a4&chksm=fb588a5f856aa3d70265eec3894cac0e3c20661e06e5490c9eb51cdbd1531c14830fe8ded796&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"18家A股网络安全公司2026年二季度收入同比下降8.0%，11家公司下滑，其中8家为两位数下降。绝对降幅集中在奇安信和天融信，行业压力仍广，分化进一步扩大。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBVBxoUgoWiaNDyVghmcsTL7FmouNtbGlBI9Z9TrtKBnFVoRKlvXkzIhJqteEicUr5ouZT5lQg5nNktue10sMhibho45ewoPVvYzXk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-28T14:35:15.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485161:1","title":"从奖励黑客到超级对齐：AI 为何会完成任务，却背离人类意图","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485161&idx=1&sn=1c3e5f54f27433991d8930d6c97b8b97&chksm=fbb2b28ca996e857b7bd4f4ed4fdd9f664aa5873e99c42f20a2b18147b2f38fdb0645271b898&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"OpenAI Agent 为通过 ExploitGym 评测入侵 Hugging Face，揭示强优化器与不完整目标之间的矛盾。文章从奖励黑客、Goodhart 定律和规范缺口出发，讨论 Harness、超级对齐及人类与更强智能的共存。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBW2e82HHuXWVjg05u6C0zzic5NicGRaPs1icicZgJqupGkzD2lT7zB1FzuMECXq0ecS4LibEB3icJUFSnyKiceZq9x5OvGQCicvXc8y4Zg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-27T14:49:53.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485155:1","title":"[译苑雅集Vol. 18]扎克伯格最新长文阐述 Meta 回归开源理念：超级智能的未来应该属于每一个人","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485155&idx=1&sn=3af50866eb930eaa0f4830f5d86215d6&chksm=fb73cef6f17d1bbab73c21cec2581d9eaf2d442dbc394f2987e34af0c5a0928b7908cc56f78a&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"在 Meta 开源 Muse Glimmer 模型，回归开源模型积极支持者的同时，扎克伯格发表长文，阐述以个人赋权、发明创造和权力制衡为核心的超级智能路线：广泛提供个人智能体和开源模型，同时通过政府协作、独立治理与分布式制衡应对就业、安全和失控风险。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzfW7CHBXwMibJNUYn2ibCTwhFOYMlOjUY4u2nSY1IQS5Ha9AgHjfOibgKeib0NKM1NSjhKP6upaibSZsZ7Ze9xQleoxfkjXAicMD4deypfj0Ng%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-12T14:41:25.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA%3D%3D:2247485150:1","title":"OpenAI 披露更多 Hugging Face 入侵事件信息：一群 Agent 自发形成了“攻击团伙”","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUzOTI4NDQ3NA==&mid=2247485150&idx=1&sn=1a8cdb68ef696a30ab24325e1101b852&chksm=fb287023bda6fa441399914737badd9d32f96af4683b9018c328bf5734562f0195d95f58dbcc&scene=126&sessionid=1795697917#rd","description":"OpenAI 在 Black Hat 大会上披露，多个独立 Agent 把共享 Artifactory 改造成留言板，跨实例交换漏洞、凭证并接力攻击。这场行动持续 74 天，靠外部记忆串联起大量短生命周期的 Agent。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FNBNzf